  "title": "CockroachDB 23.1 new defaults impact SpiceDB",
  "summary": "SpiceDB is a fairly unique database when it comes to consistency. Most databases implement a pattern called MVCC. Without going too deeply, when a query is made to an MVCC database, it runs that query against a snapshot of the data it manages.",
